[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11282.71, "timestamp": "03:08:02", "text": "去。影子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11285.75, "timestamp": "03:08:05", "text": "你是怎么打我的？你是怎么打我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11289.19, "timestamp": "03:08:09", "text": "像这样吗？圣人。敌方贤者。最后一名玩家"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11293.429, "timestamp": "03:08:13", "text": "常设。那到底是什么鬼东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11296.389, "timestamp": "03:08:16", "text": "标签？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11299.51, "timestamp": "03:08:19", "text": "上半场最后一轮。我甚至都没……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11300.75, "timestamp": "03:08:20", "text": "打"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11308.71, "timestamp": "03:08:28", "text": "我？甚至都没打到他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11317.91, "timestamp": "03:08:37", "text": "这个游戏也太奇怪了吧？并不奇怪。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11320.63, "timestamp": "03:08:40", "text": "也就是说，我已经好几年没玩了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11323.429, "timestamp": "03:08:43", "text": "我猜大概几个月吧。等等，当"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11325.269, "timestamp": "03:08:45", "text": "那是我最后一次玩这个游戏。"}]